                                                "sense_id": "4d8fc36e-fbdb-3ac6-b7bb-a28953a7c773",
                                                "text": "The current study investigates autoantibodies against steroid synthesis enzymes in dogs with spontaneous hypoadrenocorticism."
                                            },
